  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Niassa Integrated HIV and AIDS Programme - IBIS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will establish and strengthen comprehensive home-based care and food security for vulnerable households with an emphasis on agricultural techniques suitable for households affected by HIV and an effective prevention programme targeted at young people and other vulnerable people in the community.  It will also strengthen links to national level networks that are campaigning on quality care and treatment.  This is an innovative programme that brings about a partnership between more traditional service providers of HIV and livelihoods support, combined with grass root community based organisations, including associations of PLWHA, to ensure the rights of PLWHA are central to the response.</narrative>
  </description>
